{#
  ROADMAP.md Phase 11 #105 - the automated Thursday send (items 24/31)
  only ever mailed Mount Prospect's digest, since Buttondown's free plan
  is one undifferentiated list with no per-region segmentation. The
  signup form is on every region page, so a subscriber from any other
  region got the wrong town's weekend - a real defect the moment the
  list has anyone on it besides the owner. This is the fix: one issue,
  one short block per region, so every subscriber finds their own town
  in the same email.

  Same email-client constraints as email_digest.html.j2 (tables only,
  system fonts, explicit colors everywhere) and the same preview/send
  split (item 91). The dark-mode CSS (item 92) is the one piece
  actually shared, via {% include "_email_dark_mode.css.j2" %} below -
  a code-review pass found the two copies had drifted apart in comments
  (though not in the rules themselves) and that "Jinja2 has no
  cross-template partial mechanism" was simply wrong: both templates
  already render through the same FileSystemLoader Environment in
  scripts/build_digest.py, so an include resolves fine. Everything else
  below stays a second self-contained file rather than a shared
  fragment - the table markup differs enough (one region block that
  repeats vs. one flat body) that forcing it through shared partials
  would cost more in indirection than it saves in duplication.
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>{{ subject_line }}</title>
<style>
{% include "_email_dark_mode.css.j2" %}
</style>
<!--[if mso]>
<noscript>
<xml>
<o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
<o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
</o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
</xml>
</noscript>
<![endif]-->
</head>
<body class="wt-bg" style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f6f1ea;" bgcolor="#f6f1ea">
{# ROADMAP.md item 207: hidden preheader - see email_digest.html.j2's
     own copy of this comment for the full rationale. #}
<div style="display:none; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; max-height:0px; max-width:0px; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;">{{ preheader }}&#8203;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&#8203;</div>
{# Owner request 2026-10-10: "make the newsletter more fun and eye
     catching". Same email-safe rules as before (tables, inline styles,
     bgcolor attributes, system fonts, no images to block), with a bold
     hero, "Don't miss" picks, a colour per town, a date chip on every
     event and pill badges. The 600px column is now fluid (width 100%,
     max-width 600) so it no longer overflows a phone screen. #}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f6f1ea" class="wt-bg" style="background-color:#f6f1ea;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:16px 10px;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">

{% if preview %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-accent wt-border" style="padding:0 8px 12px 8px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#ae1800; border-bottom:1px dashed #d7d3d3;">
PREVIEW ONLY, NOT PART OF THE EMAIL — SUBJECT LINE: {{ subject_line }}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{# Hero #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ec3013" class="wt-hero" style="background-color:#ec3013; border-radius:18px 18px 0 0; padding:26px 24px 22px 24px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; color:#ffe9b3; padding-bottom:10px;">
WITHIN TEN &nbsp;·&nbsp; WEEKEND GUIDE
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:30px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.15; color:#ffffff; padding-bottom:10px;">
This weekend, across the northwest suburbs
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding-bottom:4px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffd23f" style="background-color:#ffd23f; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 14px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#201e1d; white-space:nowrap;">
📅 {{ weekend_date_range }}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% if event_total %}
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; padding-top:8px;">
{{ event_total }} thing{{ 's' if event_total != 1 else '' }} to do{% if town_total > 1 %} in {{ town_total }} towns{% endif %} 👇
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#201e1d" style="background-color:#201e1d; border-radius:0 0 18px 18px; padding:10px 24px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#f6f1ea;">
{% for block in region_blocks %}<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" style="color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap;"><span style="color:{{ block.tint }};">●</span> {{ block.region_name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} &nbsp; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0;"></td></tr>

{% if seasonal_link %}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#fff4d6" class="wt-card-sponsor" style="background-color:#fff4d6; border:2px dashed #f0a500; border-radius:14px; padding:14px 18px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;">
<a href="{{ seasonal_link.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:#ae1800; text-decoration:none;">{{ seasonal_link.label }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if top_picks %}
{# "Don't miss": one standout per town, chosen by pick_email_top_picks(). #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-card" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:18px; padding:20px 20px 8px 20px; border:2px solid #201e1d;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:#ae1800; padding-bottom:12px;">
⭐ DON'T MISS THIS WEEKEND
</td>
</tr>
{% for pick in top_picks %}
<tr>
<td style="padding-bottom:14px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td width="52" valign="top" style="width:52px; font-size:34px; line-height:40px; text-align:center;">{{ pick.email_emoji }}</td>
<td valign="top" style="padding-left:10px;">
<a href="{{ pick.url }}" style="font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:19px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.25; color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none;">{{ pick.title }}</a>
<div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:{{ pick.pick_color }}; padding-top:3px;">{{ pick.pick_town }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ pick.email_when or pick.date }}</div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% for block in region_blocks %}
{# Region block: {{ block.region_name }} #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="{{ block.color }}" style="background-color:{{ block.color }}; border-radius:16px 16px 0 0; padding:14px 20px;">
<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" style="font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">{{ block.region_name }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-card" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:0 0 16px 16px; padding:6px 20px 18px 20px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">

{% if block.attendable_events %}
{% for event in block.attendable_events[:4] %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:12px 0;{% if not loop.first %} border-top:1px solid #eee6dc;{% endif %}">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td width="54" valign="top" style="width:54px;">
<table role="presentation" width="54" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="{{ block.color }}" style="background-color:{{ block.color }}; border-radius:10px 10px 0 0; padding:3px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ffffff;">{{ event.email_dow or "WKND" }}</td></tr>
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="{{ block.tint }}" style="background-color:{{ block.tint }}; border-radius:0 0 10px 10px; padding:4px 0 5px 0; font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; line-height:24px; color:#201e1d;">{{ event.email_daynum or event.email_emoji }}</td></tr>
</table>
</td>
<td valign="top" style="padding-left:14px;">
{% if event.sponsored_by %}
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#ae1800; padding-bottom:3px;">Featured &middot; Presented by {{ event.sponsored_by }}</div>
{% endif %}
<span style="font-size:17px;">{{ event.email_emoji }}</span> <a href="{{ event.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.3; color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none;">{{ event.title }}</a>
{% if event.email_clock or event.email_where %}
<div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#605d5d; padding-top:3px;">{% if event.email_clock %}<span style="font-weight:bold; color:{{ block.color }};">{{ event.email_clock }}</span>{% if event.email_where %} · {% endif %}{% endif %}{% if event.email_where %}{{ event.email_where }}{% endif %}</div>
{% elif not event.email_dow and event.date %}
<div style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#605d5d; padding-top:3px;">{{ event.date }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.email_blurb %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; color:#4a4646; padding-top:4px;">{{ event.email_blurb }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.recurrence_note %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 141: same muted treatment as email_digest.html.j2. #}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-style:italic; color:#605d5d; padding-top:3px;">🔁 {{ event.recurrence_note }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.email_badges %}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:7px;"><tr>
{% for badge in event.email_badges %}<td bgcolor="{{ block.tint }}" style="background-color:{{ block.tint }}; border:1px solid {{ block.color }}; border-radius:999px; padding:2px 10px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; color:{{ block.color }};">{{ badge.emoji }} {{ badge.label }}</td>{% if not loop.last %}<td style="width:6px;"></td>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</tr></table>
{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
{% elif block.evergreen_highlights %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#605d5d; padding:12px 0 6px 0;">
Nothing new dated for this weekend yet, but worth knowing about:
</td>
</tr>
{% for item in block.evergreen_highlights %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:6px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px;">
✨ <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;">{{ item.title }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
{% elif not block.informational_events %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#605d5d; padding-top:12px;">
Nothing dated for this weekend yet — the full guide has what's coming up.
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{% if block.informational_events %}
{# ROADMAP.md Phase 11 #90, applied here independently of the branch
     above (a region with only a half-day/closure and no attendable
     events must not silently drop it). #}
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#f6f1ea" style="background-color:#f6f1ea; border-radius:10px; padding:10px 14px;">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ae1800; padding-bottom:2px;">📌 ALSO THIS WEEK</div>
{% for item in block.informational_events[:2] %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#4a4646; padding-top:3px;">{{ item.title }}{% if item.date %} — {{ item.date }}{% endif %}</div>
{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{% if block.sponsor and block.sponsor.is_active_sponsor %}
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#fff2ef" class="wt-card-sponsor" style="background-color:#fff2ef; border:2px solid #ec3013; border-radius:12px; padding:10px 14px;">
<span class="wt-accent" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.5px; color:#ae1800;">💛 LOCAL RECOMMENDATION —</span>
<a href="{{ block.sponsor.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px;">{{ block.sponsor.title }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

<tr>
<td style="padding-top:14px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="{{ block.color }}" style="background-color:{{ block.color }}; border-radius:999px;">
<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:9px 18px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">See everything in {{ block.region_name }} &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endfor %}

{% if empty_regions_summary %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 177: regions with nothing dated collapse into one
     shared block once 2+ qualify at once. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-card" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; padding:18px 20px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#605d5d; padding-bottom:8px;">
Nothing dated yet in {{ empty_regions_summary.names }} — worth knowing about:
</td>
</tr>
{% for entry in empty_regions_summary.entries %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:6px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px;">
✨ <a href="{{ entry.region_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;">{{ entry.region_name }}</a>{% if entry.highlight %} — <a href="{{ entry.highlight[0].url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none;">{{ entry.highlight[0].title }}</a>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if house_ad %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 169: house ads appear at most once per issue. #}
<tr>
<td style="padding-bottom:16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#fffaf2" class="wt-bg" style="background-color:#fffaf2; border:2px dashed #e3c9a8; border-radius:14px; padding:12px 16px;">
<span class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.5px; color:#605d5d;">📣 SPONSOR THIS SPOT —</span>
<span class="wt-muted" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#605d5d;">{{ house_ad.detail }}</span>
{% if house_ad.url %} <a href="{{ house_ad.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:#ae1800; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px;">Learn more &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{# Footer #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#201e1d" style="background-color:#201e1d; border-radius:18px; padding:22px 20px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
{% if newsletter.configured %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 183: forwarding is the one free growth channel, so a
     forwarded copy must carry a way to subscribe - a plain link to
     Buttondown's hosted page, since forms are stripped by many clients. #}
<tr>
<td align="center" style="font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; padding-bottom:12px;">
Forwarded this? Get your own every Thursday 💌
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding-bottom:16px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffd23f" style="background-color:#ffd23f; border-radius:999px;">
<a href="https://buttondown.com/{{ newsletter.buttondown_username }}?utm_source=email&utm_campaign=forward" style="display:inline-block; padding:10px 22px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#201e1d; text-decoration:none;">Get your own weekend guide &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 157: a reply is a stronger deliverability signal than
     a click, and replies reach a real inbox (item 93). #}
<tr>
<td align="center" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#f6f1ea; padding-bottom:8px;">
Know about something we missed? Hit reply — we read every one.
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#cfc7bd; padding-bottom:8px;">
See Within Ten first when you search: <a href="{{ preferred_source_url }}" style="color:#ffd23f; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:bold;">add us as a preferred source on Google &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#cfc7bd;">
Within Ten — local events within ten miles, pulled automatically from each village, library, and park district.
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
